,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Guidelight评估五大AI实验室遏制能力，OpenAI以3分排名第一</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic正式向公众免费开源内部入职培训平台Claude Academy</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI初创公司Hugging Face寻求出售，交易估值或达130亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴拟配售800亿港元新股，所得资金将全部投入AI基础设施建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d32db24ac870199f99bf2504ff9a438e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴于8月23日宣布，拟向美国境外的非美国人士配售总额800亿港元的新股，这是其2019年港股上市以来首次启动新股配售，目前交易已获超额认购。此次募集的款项净额将100%投入全栈AI能力建设及AI基础设施升级。根据2027财年第一季度财报，截至6月30日，阿里巴巴AI相关产品年化收入（ARR）已突破495亿元人民币，其中AI云与算力服务收入达484.37亿元，同比增长45%。公司预计AI资本开支有望在2至3年内收回，并设定阿里云2030年外部商业化收入达1000亿美元、利润率超20%的目标。此次大规模融资反映了阿里巴巴对AI算力长期需求的战略判断，旨在通过强化基础设施投入，进一步巩固其在AI云服务市场的竞争优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">匿名模型Ox Alpha登顶OpenRouter平台，累计调用量突破4万亿Token</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f419abb0967fa6658d75dedda0c565c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">匿名模型Ox Alpha近日上线OpenRouter后迅速登顶平台模型榜单，并刷新单日模型用量纪录。OpenRouter数据显示，仅Hermes Agent、Claude Code等前五大应用对该模型的累计调用量已超过4万亿Token，标志着其应用场景已从社区尝鲜扩展至全球开发者及Agent真实工作流。OpenRouter官方将Ox Alpha定义为面向编码、持续性Agent任务及生产工作流的推理模型，并确认由匿名第三方开发运营。目前该模型身份尚未揭晓，社区技术分析指出其Tokenizer指纹与智谱GLM系列高度接近，亦有谷歌DeepMind研究员暗示其可能与新版Gemini有关，但各方均未正式认领。Ox Alpha的大规模调用反映出AI Agent正加速进入软件开发与代码执行等实际生产流程，模型在真实工作流中</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Guidelight评估五大AI实验室遏制能力，OpenAI以3分排名第一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b7d8e20a3e9de72bffce73b4fc005000.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Guidelight AI Standards近日发布前沿AI实验室遏制能力评估报告，考察Anthropic、Google、OpenAI、Meta和xAI五家机构在监控、异常处置及失控模型关闭等方面的机制。评估结果显示，OpenAI以满分5分中的3分位居榜首，Anthropic和Meta得分最低。Guidelight定义的“遏制方案”指在AI突破控制时，明确撤销权限、限制任务及强制下线的应急流程。尽管OpenAI曾披露安全事件后的处理步骤，但仍缺乏正式的未来失控应急计划。Anthropic与Meta目前尚未公开相关响应方案。Google与OpenAI对此回应称，公开评估无法涵盖其全部内部安全机制。随着AI智能体自主执行能力提升，以及加州SB53法案生效和联邦《人工智能终止开关法案》的推进，建立可验证、可执行的“</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic正式向公众免费开源内部入职培训平台Claude Academy</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日宣布将原内部员工培训平台Claude Academy全面免费向公众开放，用户注册Claude账号即可访问。该平台包含289个学习资源，涵盖AI基础知识、Claude Code、API调用、Agents开发及生产级系统部署等核心技术领域。完成课程后，用户可获得官方颁发的结业徽章。Claude Academy的核心教学逻辑基于“AI Fluency 4D”框架，旨在培养用户与AI深度协作的心智模式，强调人类在复杂任务中应具备的思维深度，而非单纯的提示词技巧。此举不仅是Anthropic扩大技术影响力的重要举措，也为开发者及职场人士提供了系统化提升AI协作能力的路径，旨在帮助用户在AI能力快速迭代的背景下，掌握与智能工具高效协作的底层逻辑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI初创公司Hugging Face寻求出售，交易估值或达130亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7834f7e3ba20d894d2541c7759924b6a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI初创公司Hugging Face正探索出售事宜，目前已与银行合作评估潜在买家的收购兴趣，交易估值预计将达到130亿美元或更高。Hugging Face总部位于纽约，是全球核心的开源大模型与数据集托管平台。该公司在2023年的融资中估值约为45亿美元，由Salesforce、谷歌与英伟达领投。若此次出售最终落地，意味着其估值在不到三年内翻了近三倍。这一动向反映出在当前AI巨头争夺算力与生态的背景下，作为开源AI基础设施的Hugging Face已从社区资产转变为极具战略价值的收购标的，其归属权变动将对开源AI生态的未来发展产生深远影响。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
